[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14280.95, "timestamp": "03:58:00", "text": "就像，“好吧，我在这所学校活下来了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14283.83, "timestamp": "03:58:03", "text": "我吃到了那些食物。我有机会玩了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14287.51, "timestamp": "03:58:07", "text": "那所学校。”嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14289.51, "timestamp": "03:58:09", "text": "这就是为什么我喜欢尝试和测试，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14291.59, "timestamp": "03:58:11", "text": "我知道，我喜欢我会做点什么，比如3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14293.189, "timestamp": "03:58:13", "text": "几个月。如果这招行不通，我就继续前进。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14295.11, "timestamp": "03:58:15", "text": "下一个。这就是为什么在加密货币领域"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14298.63, "timestamp": "03:58:18", "text": "我得到的东西，就像我挣的300美元一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14300.71, "timestamp": "03:58:20", "text": "那场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14305.189, "timestamp": "03:58:25", "text": "是的。所以我投资了200，然后我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14308.309, "timestamp": "03:58:28", "text": "其余100个也被骗了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14311.269, "timestamp": "03:58:31", "text": "我把它弄丢了。是的。事实是，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14314.07, "timestamp": "03:58:34", "text": "失去了一条路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14316.71, "timestamp": "03:58:36", "text": "我的天啊。显然。但那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14320.63, "timestamp": "03:58:40", "text": "虚构的，因为它是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14323.99, "timestamp": "03:58:43", "text": "有人开始邀请我参加这个活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14327.189, "timestamp": "03:58:47", "text": "Discord 服务器。他说，如果你跟随我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14329.349, "timestamp": "03:58:49", "text": "我如何交易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14331.75, "timestamp": "03:58:51", "text": "如果你跟着我，那就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14333.75, "timestamp": "03:58:53", "text": "一切都会很顺利。于是我开始了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14336.71, "timestamp": "03:58:56", "text": "他说什么我就做什么。呃，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14339.91, "timestamp": "03:58:59", "text": "他让我往这个网站充值100美元。"}]